### Stores (Zustand)
- **`recipeStore`** — active recipe; NOT persisted. All ingredient actions key off `instanceId`.
  Content: `ingredients`, `portionDivisor`, `labelName`, `dimensions`, `highlightedNutrients`, `instructions`, `variables`.
  Label-meta overrides: `servingHousehold`, `addedSugarsG`, `transFatG`.
  Version tracking: `currentRecipeId`, `viewingVersionId`.
  Actions: add/remove/updateName/updateAmount/updateUnit (preserves grams)/updatePortion (preserves grams)/moveIngredient; setPortionDivisor/setLabelName/setDimensions/setHighlightedNutrients/setServingHousehold/setAddedSugarsG (clamped ≥0)/setTransFatG (clamped ≥0); addStep/updateStepText/removeStep/moveStep; addVariable (no-dup by name)/setVariableValue/updateVariable/removeVariable; clearRecipe/loadRecipe (latest version)/loadVersion/exitVersionView/setCurrentRecipeId. Internal `withInstanceIds` back-fills legacy persisted rows; `stateFromVersion` shared by load actions.
- **`savedRecipesStore`** — `nl_saved_recipes` v2; max 50 recipes × 20 versions. `RecipeSnapshot` includes servingHousehold/addedSugarsG/transFatG. `createRecipe/appendVersion/renameRecipe/deleteRecipe/deleteVersion`. On append, recipe bumped to top of list; oldest version pruned when at cap.
- **`preferencesStore`** — `nl_preferences`; `recents` (max 15) + `favorites` + `isMethodExpanded` (persisted under nested `nl_recents`/`nl_favorites`/`nl_methodExpanded` keys via partialize+merge).
- **`themeStore`** — `nl-theme`; ThemeKey: `"paper"|"overcast"|"twilight"|"midnight"`; `useActiveTheme()`, `themeVars(def, accentHex)` → CSS custom props.

